<!--
    Musichien - colours of the Android shell.

    These are the colours of the WINDOW, not of the application: the application paints itself in QML. The
    one here is the top of its gradient, so that the system bars blend into the game instead of framing it.
-->
<resources>
    <color name="musichien_night">#FF1B1035</color>

    <!--
        Le rose de l'illustration de l'icone (cuteShiba.jpg), PRELEVE dessus et non choisi a l'oeil : c'est ce qui
        garantit qu'il n'y a aucune couture entre le fond de l'icone et le premier plan, que le lanceur recadre.
    -->
    <color name="musichien_launcher_background">#FFCAEC</color>
</resources>
